B.aNh=new A.rM("The Quiet War","Addiction & compulsive habits","You are not your struggle. The fact that you are still fighting after every fall is not weakness \u2014 it is the proof of your iman. Allah does not count your falls; He counts your returns.","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f","If you are in danger of overdose or withdrawal, or you are thinking of ending your life, call your local emergency number now. A doctor or an addiction service can walk this road with you; you do not have to do it on willpower alone.",B.aPv)
B.tM=new A.eG([B.m_,B.lZ],t.Df)
B.aNe=new A.rM("Between Two Hearts","Marriage & relationships","The best of homes had hard days too. The Prophet \ufdfa was called the best of husbands \u2014 and his house still knew tears, silence, and reconciliation. Your marriage is not failing because it struggles; it is alive because you are still here.","\ud83d\udc9e","If you are ever afraid in your own home, hurt, threatened or forced, that is not a hard patch to endure quietly. Your safety comes first, and you do not have to decide anything tonight. Confidential help is one tap away below.",B.tM)
B.aNg=new A.rM("The House We Grew In","Family wounds",'Some wounds come from the hands that raised us. Yusuf \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645 was betrayed by his own brothers \u2014 and years later said: "No reproach upon you today." Healing here is not pretending it didn\u2019t hurt. It is deciding the hurt stops with you.',"\ud83c\udfe0","If someone in your family hurts or threatens you, or you are afraid to go home, you are allowed to ask for help and to put your safety first. Confidential help is one tap away below.",B.tM)
B.tL=new A.eG([B.hK],t.Df)
B.aNd=new A.rM("The Empty Chair","Grief & loss",'The Prophet \ufdfa wept when his son Ibrahim died and said: "The eye weeps, the heart grieves, and we say only what pleases our Lord." Your tears are not weak faith. They are love with nowhere to go \u2014 and Allah gathers every one of them.',"\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f","Grief can become too heavy to carry alone. If you are thinking of ending your life, please call a crisis line or your local emergency number now.",B.tL)
B.aNf=new A.rM("The Son, The Father, The Husband","A space for men who carry quietly",'You were taught to carry, not to speak. The Prophet \ufdfa cried openly, leaned on his companions, and said "I am only a man." Strength was never silence. Put it down here \u2014 no one is watching, and Allah already knows.',"\ud83c\udf11","If you are thinking of ending your life, please call a crisis line or your local emergency number now. Needing to say it out loud to a real person is not weakness.",B.tL)
B.aNi=new A.rM("The Whisper","Waswas, doubt & scrupulosity",'The companions asked the Prophet \ufdfa about the whispers that disturbed them, and he said: "That is clear faith." The whisper that torments you is not a sign of a sick heart \u2014 it is the sign of a heart Shaytan is angry with. You are not what you think. You are what you choose.',"\ud83c\udf43","If the whispers take over your days \u2014 washing, checking, repeating, or fear that will not leave \u2014 it can help to speak to a doctor or counsellor as well as a scholar. Needing both is not a failure of faith.",B.tL)
B.aqU=s([B.aNh,B.aNe,B.aNg,B.aNd,B.aNf,B.aNi],A.ac("y<rM>"))
