B.a3I=new A.fQ("Say: O My servants who have transgressed against themselves, do not despair of the mercy of Allah. Indeed, Allah forgives ALL sins.","Quran 39:53 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a3C=new A.fQ(u.c0,"Quran 12:87")
B.a3t=new A.fQ("Allah is happier with the repentance of His servant than a man who lost his camel in the desert \u2014 carrying all his food and water \u2014 and then finds it again.","Sahih Muslim 2747 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a3y=new A.fQ("By the One in Whose hand is my soul, if you did not sin, Allah would remove you and bring a people who sin and seek forgiveness \u2014 and He would forgive them.","Sahih Muslim 2749")
B.a3B=new A.fQ(u.y,"Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2499 \u2014 hasan")
B.a3H=new A.fQ("A man killed ninety-nine people, then asked if repentance was open to him \u2014 and it was. Nothing you have done has closed a door Allah keeps open.",u.fk)
B.a3u=new A.fQ("Allah accepts the repentance of His servant until the soul reaches the throat.","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3537 \u2014 hasan")
B.a3G=new A.fQ(u.dd,"Quran 94:5\u20136")
B.a3F=new A.fQ("No fatigue, illness, anxiety, sorrow or grief touches a Muslim \u2014 not even the prick of a thorn \u2014 but that Allah expiates some of his sins by it.","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a3z=new A.fQ(u.G,"Quran 13:28")
B.a3E=new A.fQ("And He is with you wherever you are.","Quran 57:4 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a3w=new A.fQ(u.f5,u.M)
B.a3s=new A.fQ(u.P,"Sahih Muslim 2877")
B.a3L=new A.fQ("Your Lord has written mercy upon Himself.","Quran 6:54 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a3A=new A.fQ("O My servants who believe \u2014 indeed, My earth is spacious, and My mercy encompasses all things.","Quran 29:56 \xb7 7:156 \u2014 excerpts")
B.a3D=new A.fQ("The dua of Yunus from inside the whale: La ilaha illa anta, subhanaka, inni kuntu minaz-zalimin \u2014 and Allah answered him. He answers you too.","Quran 21:87\u201388")
B.a3x=new A.fQ("Ya\u2019qub \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645 lost his sight from grief and said only: I complain of my sorrow and grief to Allah.","Quran 12:86 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a3J=new A.fQ("The Prophet \ufdfa, in his hardest year, was told: Your Lord has neither forsaken you nor does He hate you. And the Hereafter is better for you than the first.","Quran 93:3\u20134")
B.a3v=new A.fQ("Fear not \u2014 I am with you both; I hear and I see.","Quran 20:46 \u2014 Allah to Musa and Harun")
