B.y8=new A.et("Quran",u.G,"Quran 13:28")
B.a8i=new A.et("Hadith","Amazing is the affair of the believer \u2014 all of it is good for him: if ease reaches him he is grateful, and if hardship strikes him he is patient.","Sahih Muslim 2999 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a8l=new A.et("Dua","O Allah, I ask You for contentment after decree, and well-being in this world and the Hereafter.","Taught by the Prophet \ufdfa \u2014 Sunan Ibn Majah 3871 \u2014 sahih, excerpt")
